  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0 — the .NET 10 and C# 14 toolchain release. The SolSharp package now targets net10.0; all library, test, benchmark, and Native AOT projects, dependency locks, CI/security/release jobs, and packed-package validation use the same stable .NET 10 SDK line. Contributor tooling now build-gates deterministic StyleCop member ordering and aligns Rider/ReSharper with Roslyn's target-typed object-creation style. BREAKING: 3.0.0 no longer provides net8.0 assets; consumers must target net10.0 (or a later compatible .NET target) and recompile. Full details: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/v3.0.0/CHANGELOG.md",
